    "text": {
     "en": "Nita and Monu visit Ritu's house. Ritu's mother gives each of them milk in a different glass.\nWho got the most milk? You cannot tell by looking at the glass shape.\nRitu's elder sister pours the milk from each glass into same-sized glasses. The one who fills more same-sized glasses has more milk.\nTo compare weights use a balance. The heavier side goes down.\nTo compare the capacity of two jugs, pour from one to the other.\nSay which holds the most and which holds the least."
    }
